            "review_text": "Haagar_69\nUppsala, Sweden45 contributions\n1\nExpensive Rid-off !!\nDec 2024 • Family\nWe stopped by for a beer since we like craft beer and sometimes like to change the local Vietnamese beer for something more tasty. They had live music and the setting was nice. But, I would say it’s a total rip-off when it comes to the price. We had two 330ml draft beer from Pasteur Street Brewing, one plate of peanuts and one plate of cashews. Not only was the beer expensive (120 000 per beer) but they also added both service fee and tax!! So we ended up paying 360 000 Vnd for the beers and some nuts. \nRidiculous!\n\nSo my advice is to avoid this rip-off place and go somewhere else!\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2024",
