            "review_title": "Review at Joe's Cafe",
            "review_text": "Wenggee B\nMandaluyong, Philippines20 contributions\n0\nGood live music but in DIRE need of service & menu improvement\nMay 2023 • Couples\nGood option if you fancy live music. They're the same group who performed at Cargo Remote yesterday (30 Apr) & thought the band was really talented.\n\nAbout the food & service, it can be loads BETTER. Service was slow but I think that's because of staff shortage. Few were taking orders so you have to be on the lookout.\n\nIt's strange that nachos is served with chicken... The type that you'd normally find in a chicken fajita, it's served on nachos. We waited for tacos for more than half an hour and thought it isn't coming anymore and so we ordered cheesecake. Just as we finished the cake, out comes the tacos. We're like... Okayyyy. But just not to make a fuss, we ate what we could. Tacos could be seasoned MORE. It tasted like beef & tomato sauce, that's it.\n\nI really hope the food can be improved. It's such a nice place to hangout!\nRead more\nWritten May 1, 2023",
